<details class="search-help">
  <summary>Search syntax</summary>

  <p class="muted">
    Combine any of the filters below with plain words. Everything is
    case-insensitive, and terms are matched together (AND). Prefix any filter
    with <code>-</code> to negate it, e.g. <code>-is:public</code>.
  </p>

  <table class="search-help__table">
    <thead>
      <tr><th>Filter</th><th>Matches</th><th>Example</th></tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr>
        <td>plain words</td>
        <td>collection name or username</td>
        <td><code>board games</code></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td><code>username:</code></td>
        <td>username (partial match)</td>
        <td><code>username:ynda</code></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td><code>display_name:</code></td>
        <td>display name (partial match); quote multi-word values. Alias: <code>name:</code></td>
        <td><code>display_name:"ynda’s games"</code></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td><code>is:following</code></td>
        <td>collections you follow</td>
        <td><code>is:following</code></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td><code>is:mine</code></td>
        <td>your own collection</td>
        <td><code>is:mine</code></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td><code>is:public</code></td>
        <td>public collections (use <code>-is:public</code> for private)</td>
        <td><code>is:public</code></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td><code>is:shared</code></td>
        <td>private collections shared with you</td>
        <td><code>is:shared</code></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td><code>OR</code></td>
        <td>match <em>either</em> side; uppercase, binds looser than the implicit AND, so <code>a b OR c</code> means <code>(a AND b) OR c</code></td>
        <td><code>is:following OR is:shared</code></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td><code>AND</code></td>
        <td>optional and uppercase; terms are already ANDed, so this only aids readability</td>
        <td><code>is:public AND zelda</code></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td><code>( )</code></td>
        <td>group filters to override precedence</td>
        <td><code>(is:following OR is:mine) games</code></td>
      </tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>

  <p class="muted">
    For example, <code>is:following OR is:shared</code> shows the collections you
    follow together with private ones shared with you.
  </p>
</details>
